      <p class="_abstract">Use OpenShift API for Data Protection (OADP) to safeguard applications, application-related cluster resources, persistent volumes, and internal images on OpenShift Container Platform. OADP backs up containerized applications and virtual machines (VMs). This helps you ensure disaster recovery.</p>
      <p>However, OADP does not serve as a disaster recovery solution for <code>etcd</code> or OpenShift Operators.</p>
