        </AlertDescription>
      </Alert>
      <h2 id="oadp-apis_oadp-api" class="group scroll-mt-20">OpenShift API for Data Protection APIs<a href="#oadp-apis_oadp-api" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <p>OADP provides APIs that enable multiple approaches to customizing backups and preventing the inclusion of unnecessary or inappropriate resources.</p>
      <p>OADP provides the following APIs. See the <em>Additional resources</em> section for more details.</p>
